Package: ragdoc
Title: Point a Coding Agent at Your Docs with Retrieval-Augmented Search
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Brandt", , "jesse.a.brandt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds a hybrid-search retrieval-augmented-generation (RAG) store
    over your own documentation sources and serves it to coding agents through a
    Model Context Protocol search tool. Point it at the sites you want indexed
    and agents retrieve the actual passages, each returned with a
    source-and-URL citation, instead of guessing. A thin, opinionated layer over
    'ragnar' that adds a resilient crawl-and-build pipeline, per-connection
    full-text search setup, graceful retrieval fallback, and one-line MCP
    serving.
